> AI-Editor Extensions repositories are supported as **remote** repositories only, so the provider exposes no <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`artifactoryLocalAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ArtifactoryLocalAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-go="`artifactoryLocalAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-python="`artifactory_local_aieditorextensions_repository`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`artifactoryLocalAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-java="`artifactoryLocalAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`artifactory_local_aieditorextensions_repository`">`artifactoryLocalAieditorextensionsRepository`</span>, <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`artifactoryVirtualAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ArtifactoryVirtualAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-go="`artifactoryVirtualAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-python="`artifactory_virtual_aieditorextensions_repository`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`artifactoryVirtualAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-java="`artifactoryVirtualAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`artifactory_virtual_aieditorextensions_repository`">`artifactoryVirtualAieditorextensionsRepository`</span>, or <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`artifactoryFederatedAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ArtifactoryFederatedAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-go="`artifactoryFederatedAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-python="`artifactory_federated_aieditorextensions_repository`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`artifactoryFederatedAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-java="`artifactoryFederatedAieditorextensionsRepository`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`artifactory_federated_aieditorextensions_repository`">`artifactoryFederatedAieditorextensionsRepository`</span> resource.

> <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`url`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Url`" pulumi-lang-go="`url`" pulumi-lang-python="`url`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`url`" pulumi-lang-java="`url`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`url`">`url`</span> is required. Unlike some package types, Artifactory does not fall back to a default gallery URL for AI-Editor Extensions, so it must be set on every repository. Ex: Use `https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/_apis/public/gallery` for the VS Code marketplace.

